<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -  Books-A-Million cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -  Books-A-Million cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has reduced its rating for Books-A-Million Inc to neutral from buy, a source at the firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The Birmingham, Ala., book retailer's shares closed on Friday at 6-1/2, close to a 12-month low.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
